{
  "slug": "norman-mcp-server",
  "name": "Norman Mcp Server",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Norman brings your finances into Claude. Create invoices, categorize transactions, match receipts, file VAT — all through chat. Built for for entrepreneurs at the heart of the European economy. Comes with 10 ready-to-use skills like monthly reconciliation, expense reports, and tax deduction finder. Connects via OAuth, so just log in and go.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **18 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (18): `categorize-transactions` (Review and categorize uncategorized bank transactions, match them with invoices, and verify bookkeeping entries), `company-incorporation` (Found a German GmbH or UG (haftungsbeschränkt) through a guided chat), `corporate-tax-registration` (Prepare the corporate tax registration (Fragebogen zur steuerlichen Erfassung for a GmbH/UG) through a guided chat), `create-invoice` (Create and optionally send a new invoice to a client), `expense-report` (Generate a detailed expense breakdown by category for a given period), `financial-overview` (Get a complete financial overview of the business including balance, recent transactions, outstanding invoices, and upcoming tax obligations), `find-receipts` (Find and attach missing receipts for business transactions), `gewerbe-registration` (Prepare a German trade-office registration (Gewerbeanmeldung, form GewA 1) through a guided chat), and 10 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `norman-finance`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install norman-mcp-server@claude-community` from `norman-finance/norman-mcp-server`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 18,
    "mcp": 1
  },
